message: "If you use this software or data, please cite it as below."
title: "TB-BOPAS: India's drug-resistant tuberculosis surveillance, 2017-2024, and an AI-assisted, human-checked evidence map of tuberculosis interventions"
abstract: >-
  Code, data and outputs for two linked analyses. First, national trends in
  India's drug-resistant tuberculosis surveillance, 2017-2024, reconstructed from
  WHO Global TB Programme country data with per-datapoint provenance and scored
  with a Bayesian priority-action score. Second, an evidence map of the
  tuberculosis intervention literature: 3,589 record-intervention pairs for
  twelve interventions, coded by a large language model with a verbatim
  supporting quote as evaluation, relevant evidence or off-topic, checked against
  two human coders, and summarised as rule-based evidence-readiness tiers.
type: dataset
